# Build context allowlist (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# Only what the image needs: never packs, mask stores, keys, accounts databases, caches or tests.
*
!pyproject.toml
!requirements/provider-cpu.txt
!README.md
!src/
!rust/
rust/target
rust/**/target
!deploy/docker/entrypoint.sh
!deploy/docker/provider-entrypoint.sh
!deploy/docker/healthcheck.py
!deploy/runpod/pod_boot.py
!deploy/runpod/rtt_probe.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.so
**/*.egg-info
